---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="programs">
  <div class="prog-header">
    <p class="sec-label">Where Your Support Goes</p>
    <h2 class="sec-title">PROGRAMS YOUR DOLLARS POWER.</h2>
    <p class="sec-desc">
      Four active programs running right now across Alabama, every one funded by the AV Circle.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="prog-row">
    <div class="prog-photo">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/a189b91ddd264ddc.webp`}
        alt="Veterans at Warrior Retreat at Shack 33"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="prog-body pb-blue">
      <div class="prog-tag">Men's Program</div>
      <div class="prog-name">WARRIOR RETREAT</div>
      <p class="prog-desc">
        A four-day fellowship for healing trauma through Post-Traumatic Growth and Wellbeing.
        Fishing, shooting, and kayaking combined with equine and art therapy create a powerful space
        for self-reflection and lasting recovery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prog-row flip">
    <div class="prog-photo">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/76acf7088b16f08c.webp`}
        alt="Another men's Warrior Retreat group at Shack 33"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="prog-body pb-red">
      <div class="prog-tag">Veterans and Their Families</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Marriage Retreat</div>
      <p class="prog-desc">
        Addressing the unique transitions and traumas experienced by veterans' spouses, with the
        goal of countering high divorce rates among combat veterans. The program fosters open
        communication, reconciliation, and the tools couples need to navigate their PTG journey
        together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prog-row">
    <div class="prog-photo">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/181dec4133259b38.webp`}
        alt="Veterans group at peer support gathering"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="prog-body pb-red">
      <div class="prog-tag">Statewide Program</div>
      <div class="prog-name">PEER-TO-PEER SUPPORT</div>
      <p class="prog-desc">
        Led by certified veteran peer-support specialists, these individual and group sessions held
        at safe locations statewide provide mentoring, camaraderie, and belonging. They serve as a
        force multiplier for every other AV initiative across the state.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prog-row flip">
    <div class="prog-photo">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/50f5d7eee9055ae0.webp`}
        alt="Large group of veterans marching with American flags at AV Active event"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="prog-body pb-blue">
      <div class="prog-tag">Be Someone's 9-Line</div>
      <div class="prog-name">AV AMBASSADOR PROGRAM</div>
      <p class="prog-desc">
        Ambassadors engage veterans statewide through mentoring, outdoor activities, and resource
        facilitation. They also provide immediate 9-Line crisis response, connecting veterans in
        need with housing, food, clothing, and support when it matters most.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
